# Every frozen scientific identity in this repository is a SHA-256 over file
# bytes. A checkout must therefore hand back exactly the bytes git stores, on
# every platform: with core.autocrlf=true an unpinned text file arrives as CRLF
# and its recorded digest stops reproducing.
#
# The rule is repository-wide on purpose. A per-file allowlist only covers the
# files someone remembered to add, and silently breaks the next time a hash is
# frozen over a file that is not on it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary evidence must never be line-ending filtered.
*.npz binary
